20:50:27 [DEBUG] anthropic._base_client: Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-bca94103-8be0-4e57-98e3-3e3152bf8bbf', 'content': None, 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 4096, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'You\'re looking at my koto project. I don\'t know FL Studio deeply — walk me through everything.\n  ▎ Here\'s what I need you to do:\n  ▎\n  ▎ Step 1 — Read the project. Orient yourself (do it fast, all at once). Then call\n  ▎ read_project_state so you know every mixer track by name and ID. List them for me — I want to\n  ▎ see what you found.\n  ▎\n  ▎ Step 2 — Render everything. Tell me exactly what to click in FL, then wait. I\'ll do one Ctrl+R\n  ▎ to export all stems and the master. Don\'t proceed until the renders land.\n  ▎\n  ▎ Step 3 — Find the 3 biggest problems. Analyze all the stems. Use compare_stems on the busiest\n  ▎ pairs (bass vs kick, for example). Use find_resonances on anything that looks harsh or muddy.\n  ▎ Tell me: what are the top 3 mix problems with exact dB numbers? Rank them by how much they\'re\n  ▎ hurting the mix.\n  ▎\n  ▎ Step 4 — Fix the #1 problem. Snapshot first. State your predicted delta. Apply the fix.\n  ▎ Re-render just the affected track and master. Show me before/after as a table.\n  ▎\n  ▎ Step 5 — Compress the drum bus. Find the drum bus track. If Fruity Compressor is already loaded\n  ▎  in slot 0, use set_compressor with: threshold -12 dB, ratio 2:1, attack 10 ms, release 80 ms,\n  ▎ +1 dB makeup. If it\'s not loaded, tell me to add it and which track to put it on. After\n  ▎ applying, read me the exact knob values FL shows (right-click each knob → "edit value") — I\n  ▎ need this for calibration.\n  ▎\n  ▎ Step 6 — Sidechain the 808 to the kick. Wire it using apply_sidechain. Read me the advisory\n  ▎ verbatim so I can confirm the dropdown in FL. Tell me when to say "done".\n  ▎\n  ▎ Step 7 — Final report. Write a history entry. Tell me: what\'s fixed, what\'s still open, and\n  ▎ what you\'d do next session.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'text': "I'll start by orienting myself on all five dimensions at once — let me fire those in parallel right now.", 'type': 'text'}, {'id': 'toolu_01S4rx4CjiX9RfaYDmQi96xS', 'caller': {'type': 'direct'}, 'input': {}, 'name': 'get_workspace_status', 'type': 'tool_use'}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01S4rx4CjiX9RfaYDmQi96xS', 'content': '{"project_name": "koto", "root": "C:\\\\Users\\\\mpamp\\\\StudioMind\\\\projects\\\\koto", "fl_project_path": null, "stems_dir": "C:\\\\Users\\\\mpamp\\\\StudioMind\\\\projects\\\\koto\\\\stems", "masters_dir": "C:\\\\Users\\\\mpamp\\\\StudioMind\\\\projects\\\\koto\\\\masters", "references_dir": "C:\\\\Users\\\\mpamp\\\\StudioMind\\\\projects\\\\koto\\\\references", "drops_dir": "C:\\\\Users\\\\mpamp\\\\StudioMind\\\\projects\\\\koto\\\\drops", "stems": [{"kind": "stem", "filename": "koto_Omnisphere [64bit].wav", "status": "pending", "track_id": 1, "track_name": "Omnisphere [64bit]", "fl_state_hash": "868e09aa319ba6d8", "rendered_at": null, "analysis": null}, {"kind": "stem", "filename": "koto_[reese] bob cochonou.wav", "status": "pending", "track_id": 2, "track_name": "[reese] bob cochonou", "fl_state_hash": "4949a779894b6665", "rendered_at": null, "analysis": null}, {"kind": "stem", "filename": "koto_[808] choucroute.wav", "status": "pending", "track_id": 3, "track_name": "[808] choucroute", "fl_state_hash": "d6af0867ae197265", "rendered_at": null, "analysis": null}, {"kind": "stem", "filename": "koto_JP - Simmie Hat.wav", "status": "pending", "track_id": 4, "track_name": "JP - Simmie Hat", "fl_state_hash": "f07627c9ea9d184c", "rendered_at": null, "analysis": null}, {"kind": "stem", "filename": "koto_JP - Low Hat.wav", "status": "pending", "track_id": 5, "track_name": "JP - Low Hat", "fl_state_hash": "0ed881