20:56:01 [DEBUG] anthropic._base_client: Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-c445bf8a-f155-4a5c-af1c-a71984eb1283', 'content': None, 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 600, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'You are summarising a StudioMind mixing session for context compaction.\nProduce a concise summary (≤400 words) that preserves:\n- Audio measurements: LUFS, dB values, spectral band readings, true peak\n- Changes applied: which track, what was changed, exact values\n- User decisions: which changes were kept vs reverted\n- Current project state: what\'s been fixed, what\'s still open\n- Any user preferences or constraints stated during the session\nDiscard: verbose tool outputs, re-reads of unchanged state, conversational filler.\n\nSession to summarise:\n[{"role": "user", "content": "You\'re looking at my koto project. I don\'t know FL Studio deeply — walk me through everything.\\n  ▎ Here\'s what I need you to do:\\n  ▎\\n  ▎ Step 1 — Read the project. Orient yourself (do it fast, all at once). Then call\\n  ▎ read_project_state so you know every mixer track by name and ID. List them for me — I want to\\n  ▎ see what you found.\\n  ▎\\n  ▎ Step 2 — Render everything. Tell me exactly what to click in FL, then wait. I\'ll do one Ctrl+R\\n  ▎ to export all stems and the master. Don\'t proceed until the renders land.\\n  ▎\\n  ▎ Step 3 — Find the 3 biggest problems. Analyze all the stems. Use compare_stems on the busiest\\n  ▎ pairs (bass vs kick, for example). Use find_resonances on anything that looks harsh or muddy.\\n  ▎ Tell me: what are the top 3 mix problems with exact dB numbers? Rank them by how much they\'re\\n  ▎ hurting the mix.\\n  ▎\\n  ▎ Step 4 — Fix the #1 problem. Snapshot first. State your predicted delta. Apply the fix.\\n  ▎ Re-render just the affected track and master. Show me before/after as a table.\\n  ▎\\n  ▎ Step 5 — Compress the drum bus. Find the drum bus track. If Fruity Compressor is already loaded\\n  ▎  in slot 0, use set_compressor with: threshold -12 dB, ratio 2:1, attack 10 ms, release 80 ms,\\n  ▎ +1 dB makeup. If it\'s not loaded, tell me to add it and which track to put it on. After\\n  ▎ applying, read me the exact knob values FL shows (right-click each knob → \\"edit value\\") — I\\n  ▎ need this for calibration.\\n  ▎\\n  ▎ Step 6 — Sidechain the 808 to the kick. Wire it using apply_sidechain. Read me the advisory\\n  ▎ verbatim so I can confirm the dropdown in FL. Tell me when to say \\"done\\".\\n  ▎\\n  ▎ Step 7 — Final report. Write a history entry. Tell me: what\'s fixed, what\'s still open, and\\n  ▎ what you\'d do next session."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": ["TextBlock(citations=None, text=\\"I\'ll start by orienting myself on all five dimensions at once — let me fire those in parallel right now.\\", type=\'text\')", "ToolUseBlock(id=\'toolu_01S4rx4CjiX9RfaYDmQi96xS\', caller=DirectCaller(type=\'direct\'), input={}, name=\'get_workspace_status\', type=\'tool_use\')"]}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"type": "tool_result", "tool_use_id": "toolu_01S4rx4CjiX9RfaYDmQi96xS", "content": "{\\"project_name\\": \\"koto\\", \\"root\\": \\"C:\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\mpamp\\\\\\\\StudioMind\\\\\\\\projects\\\\\\\\koto\\", \\"fl_project_path\\": null, \\"stems_dir\\": \\"C:\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\mpamp\\\\\\\\StudioMind\\\\\\\\projects\\\\\\\\koto\\\\\\\\stems\\", \\"masters_dir\\": \\"C:\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\mpamp\\\\\\\\StudioMind\\\\\\\\projects\\\\\\\\koto\\\\\\\\masters\\", \\"references_dir\\": \\"C:\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\mpamp\\\\\\\\StudioMind\\\\\\\\projects\\\\\\\\koto\\\\\\\\references\\", \\"drops_dir\\": \\"C:\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\mpamp\\\\\\\\StudioMind\\\\\\\\projects\\\\\\\\koto\\\\\\\\drops\\", \\"stems\\": [{\\"kind\\": \\"stem\\", \\"filename\\": \\"koto_Omnisphere [64bit].wav\\", \\"status\\": \\"pending\\", \\"track_id\\": 1, \\"track