20:59:13 [DEBUG] anthropic._base_client: Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-9592043a-fc06-4a13-b941-0403df8cf167', 'content': None, 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 600, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'You are summarising a StudioMind mixing session for context compaction.\nProduce a concise summary (≤400 words) that preserves:\n- Audio measurements: LUFS, dB values, spectral band readings, true peak\n- Changes applied: which track, what was changed, exact values\n- User decisions: which changes were kept vs reverted\n- Current project state: what\'s been fixed, what\'s still open\n- Any user preferences or constraints stated during the session\nDiscard: verbose tool outputs, re-reads of unchanged state, conversational filler.\n\nSession to summarise:\n[{"role": "user", "content": "[Context from earlier in this session — auto-compacted to save tokens]\\n\\n# **koto — Session Summary**\\n\\n## **Project State**\\n- **20 mixer tracks:** 18 active stems + 4 silent/unused; tracks 18–20 have empty inserts\\n- **Master:** -14.2 LUFS, **0.0 dBTP** (clipping—zero headroom)\\n- **Recent external changes:** Tracks 1 (Omnisphere) & 3 (808) modified since last render\\n\\n### **Key Track Measurements**\\n| Track | Name | LUFS | True Peak | Centroid |\\n|-------|------|------|-----------|----------|\\n| 10 | Nuclear Kick | -11.0 | -4.0 dB | 371 Hz |\\n| 3 | 808 choucroute | -16.6 | -5.6 dB | 206 Hz |\\n| 9 | JP - Bongo Perc | -22.8 | -4.5 dB | 1.5 kHz |\\n| 14 | koto thing | -24.1 | -8.6 dB | 2.2 kHz |\\n| 2 | reese bob cochonou | -27.3 | -18.1 dB | 157 Hz |\\n\\n---\\n\\n## **Changes Applied & Decisions**\\n\\n### **Track 14 (koto thing) — Low-mid Reduction**\\n**7 successive EQ adjustments to band 1 (built-in EQ):**\\n- **Final:** -5.72 dB @ 295.6 Hz, Q≈1.5\\n- **Result:** Low-mid dropped ~1.7 dB cumulatively; stem LUFS improved