20:59:30 [DEBUG] anthropic._base_client: Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-e7f2b3a1-9f6c-4203-9011-9da64ef5b25f', 'content': None, 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 600, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'You are summarising a StudioMind mixing session for context compaction.\nProduce a concise summary (≤400 words) that preserves:\n- Audio measurements: LUFS, dB values, spectral band readings, true peak\n- Changes applied: which track, what was changed, exact values\n- User decisions: which changes were kept vs reverted\n- Current project state: what\'s been fixed, what\'s still open\n- Any user preferences or constraints stated during the session\nDiscard: verbose tool outputs, re-reads of unchanged state, conversational filler.\n\nSession to summarise:\n[{"role": "user", "content": "[Context from earlier in this session — auto-compacted to save tokens]\\n\\n# **koto — Session Summary**\\n\\n## **Project State**\\n- **20 mixer tracks:** 2 active (drum bus, bass); 16 currently muted; 2 empty inserts\\n- **Master:** -14.2 LUFS, **0.0 dBTP** (clipping—zero headroom)\\n- **BPM:** 121; **PPQ:** 96\\n- **Recent external changes:** Tracks 1 (Omnisphere) & 4 ([808] choucroute) modified since last render\\n- **⚠️ Render status:** Batch render prepared for 2 active stems + master; **16 tracks currently muted** (will export silent unless un-muted first)\\n\\n---\\n\\n## **Key Track Measurements (Previous Session)**\\n| Track | Name | LUFS | True Peak | Centroid |\\n|-------|------|------|-----------|----------|\\n| 11 | Nuclear Kick | -11.0 | -4.0 dB | 371 Hz |\\n| 4 | 808 choucroute | -16.6 | -5.6 dB | 206 Hz |\\n| 10 | JP - Bongo Perc | -22.8 | -4.5 dB | 1.5 kHz |\\n| 15 | koto thing | -24.1 | -8.6 dB | 2.2 kHz |\\n| 3 | reese bob cochonou | -27.3 | -18.1 dB | 157 Hz |\\n\\n---\\n\\n## **Changes Applied & Decisions (Previous Session)**\\n\\n### **Track 15 (koto thing) — Low-mid Reduction**\\n**7 successive EQ adjustments (built-in EQ, band 1):**\\n- **Final setting:** -5.72 dB @ 295.6 Hz, Q≈1.5\\n- **Result:** Low-mid dropped ~1.7 dB cumulatively; stem LUFS improved -24.1 → -25.5; master true peak improved ~0.7 dB\\n- **User decision:** ✓ **All 7 adjustments kept**\\n- **Limitation noted:** Built-in EQ resolution insufficient for exact -2 dB @ 300 Hz target; Pro-Q 3 recommended for surgical precision\\n\\n---\\n\\n## **Critical Issues (Open)**\\n\\n1. **Master clipping (0.0 dBTP)** — No headroom; gain reduction required\\n2. **Track"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Understood. I have the context from earlier. Continuing."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": ["TextBlock(citations=None, text=\\"Here are your exact click-by-click instructions for FL Studio:\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n### 🎛️ FL Studio Export Instructions\\\\n\\\\n1. **Un-mute all tracks first** — in the Mixer, click the green LED on every track that\'s currently dark/muted\\\\n2. In FL Studio, go to the top menu: **File → Export → Wave file…** (or press **Ctrl+R**)\\\\n3. A dialog will open. Set the **Mode** dropdown to: **`Tracks (separate audio files)`**\\\\n4. Set the output folder to:\\\\n   ```\\\\n   C:\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\mpamp\\\\\\\\StudioMind\\\\\\\\projects\\\\\\\\koto\\\\\\\\stems\\\\n   ```\\\\n5. Click **Start** and let it finish\\\\n\\\\nOnce that\'s done, do a **second export** for the master:\\\\n- **File → Export → Wave file…** again\\\\n- Mode: **`Full song`**\\\\n- Output folder: `C:\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\mpamp\\\\\\\\StudioMind\\\\\\\\projects\\\\\\\\koto\\\\\\\\masters`\\\\n- Filename: **`master_1777398654.wav`**\\\\n- Click **Start**\\\\n\\\\n**Tell me when both exports are done and I\'ll start analyzing immediately.**\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n*(Waiting for your renders to land...)*\\", type=\'text\')", "ToolUseBlock(id=\'toolu_014AUHwJFZjGQref2LShyuaL\', caller=DirectCaller(type=\'direct\'), input={\'timeout_s