21:03:38 [DEBUG] anthropic._base_client: Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-885d0c65-9efb-4798-b940-d179e4f257b7', 'content': None, 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 4096, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': '[Context from earlier in this session — auto-compacted to save tokens]\n\n# **koto — Session Summary**\n\n## **Project State**\n- **20 mixer tracks:** Batch render completed with 16 stems + master successfully exported\n- **Master:** -11.3 LUFS, **0.0 dBTP** (clipping—zero headroom persists)\n- **BPM:** 121; **PPQ:** 96\n- **Render status:** ✓ 16 stems analyzed; 3 stems pending (tracks 2, 10, 18); 2 inserts failed (tracks 19, 20)\n\n---\n\n## **Completed Stem Analysis**\n\n| Track | Name | LUFS | True Peak | Centroid | Status |\n|-------|------|------|-----------|----------|--------|\n| 1 | drum bus | -11.3 | -3.5 dB | 369.5 Hz | ✓ |\n| 3 | bass | -27.3 | -18.0 dB | 158.5 Hz | ✓ |\n| 4 | JP - Simmie Hat | -34.9 | -15.2 dB | 10.2 kHz | ✓ |\n| 5 | JP - Low Hat | -37.6 | -22.1 dB | 3.7 kHz | ✓ |\n| 6 | JP - Crack Hat | -30.5 | -14.5 dB | 5.6 kHz | ✓ |\n| 7 | JP - Greek Clap | -28.5 | -10.9 dB | 3.9 kHz | ✓ |\n| 8 | JP - Metal Clap | -22.5 | -6.9 dB | 5.2 kHz | ✓ |\n| 9 | JP - Bongo Perc | -22.8 | -4.5 dB | 1.5 kHz | ✓ |\n| 11 | Kontakt 5 | -120.0 | -200.0 dB | — | Silent |\n| 12 | Kontakt 5 #2 | -120.0 | -200.0 dB | — | Silent |\n| 13 | Omnisphere [64bit] #2 | -120.0 | -200.0 dB | — | Silent |\n| 14 | koto thing | -24.1'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Understood. I have the context from earlier. Continuing.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'what ever i gave you in the first prompt'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'text': 'Let me check the project history and notes to see what you provided at the start.', 'type': 'text'}, {'id': 'toolu_01K4GZrMCsU8aBHfbP2taZPH', 'caller': {'type': 'direct'}, 'input': {}, 'name': 'r